---
// Legal / policy page (page, decimal numbering, contents + change banner) — Caldera: Warranty & returns v3.0.
---

<section id="legal-policy" class="section legal-policy">
  <!-- kit: legal-policy -->
  <article class="container narrow">
    <div class="change-banner" role="note">
      <strong>Updated 1 October 2026.</strong> This is version 3.0 of our warranty and returns policy. <a href="#legal-versions">See what changed</a>
    </div>

    <header class="policy-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Policy</span>
      <h1>Warranty & returns</h1>
      <p class="meta">Effective <time datetime="2026-10-01">1 October 2026</time> · Version 3.0</p>
      <div class="summary">
        <p>Cast iron and carbon steel are covered for life against cracks, warps and failed welds. Unused items can come back within 60 days for a full refund. Seasoning wear isn't a defect.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <nav class="contents" aria-label="Contents">
      <p class="contents-title">Contents</p>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#lifetime-warranty"><span>1.</span> Lifetime warranty</a></li>
        <li><a href="#returns"><span>2.</span> Returns</a></li>
        <li><a href="#legal-versions"><span>3.</span> Version history</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <section class="policy-section" id="lifetime-warranty" aria-labelledby="lifetime-warranty-h">
      <h2 id="lifetime-warranty-h"><span class="num">1.</span> Lifetime warranty</h2>
      <div class="clause">
        <h3><span class="num">1.1</span> What's covered</h3>
        <div class="clause-grid">
          <div class="clause-body">
            <p>Caldera warrants every cast iron and carbon steel product against defects in materials and workmanship, including cracking, warping beyond 1.5 mm and weld failure, for the life of the product.</p>
          </div>
          <aside class="plain" aria-label="In plain English">
            <p class="plain-label">In plain English</p>
            <p>If it cracks, warps or a weld fails, we replace it. Forever.</p>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="clause">
        <h3><span class="num">1.2</span> What isn't</h3>
        <div class="clause-grid">
          <div class="clause-body">
            <p>Rust, seasoning loss, discolouration and damage from misuse — including thermal shock from cold water on a hot pan — are not defects.</p>
          </div>
          <aside class="plain" aria-label="In plain English">
            <p class="plain-label">In plain English</p>
            <p>Rust and worn seasoning are fixable, not faults. We'll show you how.</p>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="policy-section" id="returns" aria-labelledby="returns-h">
      <h2 id="returns-h"><span class="num">2.</span> Returns</h2>
      <div class="clause">
        <h3><span class="num">2.1</span> 60-day window</h3>
        <div class="clause-body">
          <p>Unused items in original packaging may be returned within 60 days of delivery for a full refund to the original payment method.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="clause">
        <h3><span class="num">2.2</span> How to start a return</h3>
        <div class="clause-body">
          <p>Start a return at <a href="/returns">caldera.bettercms.site/returns</a> with your order number. We email a prepaid label within one business day.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="policy-section" id="legal-versions" aria-labelledby="legal-versions-h">
      <h2 id="legal-versions-h"><span class="num">3.</span> Version history</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Version</th><th scope="col">Effective</th><th scope="col">What changed</th><th scope="col">Archive</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>3.0</td>
              <td><time datetime="2026-10-01">1 Oct 2026</time></td>
              <td>Current version.</td>
              <td>—</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2.1</td>
              <td><time datetime="2025-03-01">1 Mar 2025</time></td>
              <td>Returns window extended from 30 to 45 days.</td>
              <td><a href="https://caldera.bettercms.site/media/legal/warranty-returns-v2-1.pdf">PDF, 186 KB</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2.0</td>
              <td><time datetime="2024-01-15">15 Jan 2024</time></td>
              <td>Carbon steel added to the lifetime warranty.</td>
              <td><a href="https://caldera.bettercms.site/media/legal/warranty-returns-v2-0.pdf">PDF, 171 KB</a></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="contact">
      <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:care@caldera.co">care@caldera.co</a>.</p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</section>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 860px;
  }
  .change-banner {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.125rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--brand-soft);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .change-banner a {
    color: var(--brand);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .policy-head h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
  }
  .meta {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .summary {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }
  .summary p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contents {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .contents-title {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .contents ol {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .contents a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .contents span {
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .policy-section {
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    scroll-margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .policy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.625rem;
  }
  .num {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    margin-right: 0.25rem;
  }
  .clause {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .clause h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
  .clause-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 240px;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .clause-body {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .plain {
    padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--success) 8%, var(--bg));
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .plain p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .plain-label {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem !important;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--success);
  }
  .table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 520px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  th,
  td {
    padding: 0.625rem 0.875rem;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  th {
    background: var(--surface);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  td a {
    color: var(--accent);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .contact {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .clause-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
